        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 560, Simple Polished Chrome Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis sleek modern door lever set from Omnia features a circular rose combined with a flat lever. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden). It fits standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door preparation.  It will fit 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" or 2\" door thicknesses with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. The 560 Lever has a polished chrome finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout. All dimensions are standard to fit existing bores for easy replacement installations.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classic Door Lever Latchset With Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets ADA accessibility requirements.</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Construction</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 560 Solid Brass Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diamater: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door by using a 7mm solid spindle. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Uses 7mm split spindle. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Polished Chrome Lever Latchset, Omnia 560/00-US26",
                "description": "Omnia 560/00 Solid Brass Lever Latchset - This sleek modern door lever set from Omnia features a circular rose combined with a flat lever. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden), for a very smooth look. It fits standard 2-1/8 inches bore hole door preparation.  It will fit 1-3/8 inches, 1-3/4 inches or 2 inches door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches backsets. The 560 Lever has a polished chrome finish.",
                "keywords": "Omnia 560 Lever Latchsets, OMN-560/00, Omnia Modern door levers, solid brass lever latchsets, Omnia contemporary door levers, solid brass door levers, passage levers, privacy levers, dummy levers, Classic Door Levers, ada compliant levers, OMN-560/00-US26, Omnia 560/00-US26, Polished Chrome Lever Latchsets, Simple Polished Chrome Lever"
